# The shadow cache scene, which F7 in mygame cycles to (see docs/rendering/lighting-and-shadows.md#caching): a door that
# swings on its hinge in front of a wall, and a crate that a blinker hides and shows, under a sun with the virtual shadow
# map's cache. The door's shadow follows it and leaves no trail, the crate's goes and comes in the frame that it does,
# and the Shadow_Virtual_Invalidated debug view shows only the pages under them drawing again. Positions are raw
# World_Position values in units of 2^-24 m. The editor writes this file; see docs/editor/document-and-scenes.md#scenes.
